// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Skulls_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3796355347" "The Skulls' leaders, the Bone Daddies, have become living embodiments of the power of death. They can literally suck the life out of a foe to feed their own spirits. They can also focus the pure darkness of the netherworld into physical attacks that cause massive damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P2820886347" "Bone Daddy"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Skulls_DarkAssault_Boss_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3832606446" "The Death Walkers, like their Death Doll sisters, are an elite force among the Skulls who have learned how to twist the power of death into fearsome attacks that disable their foes while draining away their life essence. Even among the Skulls, who have dedicated themselves to death itself, they are a frightening force to be reckoned with."
// DisplayNames :
"P281053861" "Death Walker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Skulls_DarkAssault_Boss_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4174098050" "The Death Dolls, like their Death Walker brothers, are an elite force among the Skulls who have learned how to twist the power of death into fearsome attacks that disable their foes while draining away their life essence. Even among the Skulls, who have dedicated themselves to death itself, they are a frightening force to be reckoned with."
// DisplayNames :
"P2577315782" "Death Doll"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Skulls_Petrovic_Chernobog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2325441212" "Bolek Petrovic is the youngest of the Petrovic brothers. As one of the Lords of Death he is a leader of the Skulls street gang in Paragon City. Like his brother he took the name of an ancient Slavic deity when he learned the black arts. Chernobog was known as 'The Black God' to the ancient Slavic tribes, and little is truly known of him. What is known of Bolek Petrovic, however, is that he is a merciless killer who possesses terrible strength."
// DisplayNames :
"P2732322126" "Chernobog"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Skulls_Petrovic_Morana 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3090436143" "Little is known of the woman known as Morana except that she is revered by the Death Dolls within the Skulls and feared by their enemies. It is uncertain whether she has taken the name of a Slavic deity like the Petrovic Brothers, or if she truly is a manifestation of the Slavic goddess of death and nightmares. What is certain is that she is responsible for the deaths of hundreds."
// DisplayNames :
"P1351517802" "Morana"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Skulls_Petrovic_Veles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P408916618" "Viktor Petrovic is the eldest of the Petrovics. As one of the Lords of Death he is a leader of the Skulls street gang in Paragon City. Together, with his siblings, he formed a pact with dark powers to learn the black arts. He took the name of Veles, an ancient Slavic deity of the underworld, magic, and trickery. Unlike his siblings, Veles leads the Skulls through guile and cunning rather than death and fear. Whether he commands respect from his siblings due to familial love or even greater strength remains unknown."
// DisplayNames :
"P3988932455" "Veles"

